@startuml C4_Create_Vessel_Visit_Execution_Process_View
title C4 – Create Vessel Visit Execution (Process View)
hide footbox

actor "Logistics Operator" as LogisticsOp
participant "Frontend Web App\n(React / Angular)" as Frontend
participant "Vessel Visit Execution API\n(ASP.NET Core)" as API
participant "External IAM Provider\n(OAuth 2.0 / OIDC)" as IAM
database "PLMS Database\n(SQL / InMemory)" as DB

== Autenticação ==
LogisticsOp -> Frontend : Inicia sessão (credenciais)
Frontend -> IAM : Solicita Token OAuth 2.0
IAM --> Frontend : Retorna Access Token (JWT)

== Criação de Vessel Visit Execution ==
LogisticsOp -> Frontend : Submete formulário (VVN selecionado, dados do VVE)
Frontend -> API : POST /api/VesselVisitExecutions (JSON + Bearer Token)
API -> IAM : Valida token JWT
IAM --> API : Token válido

== Validação e Preparação ==
API -> DB : Valida VVN existente
DB --> API : VVN encontrado (OK)
API -> API : Gera identificador VVE\nRegistra arrival time\nDefine creator user ID\nMarca status = "In Progress"

== Persistência ==
API -> DB : INSERT INTO VesselVisitExecutions (...)
DB --> API : Confirmação (OK)

== Resposta ==
API --> Frontend : HTTP 201 Created (VVEDTO com status "In Progress")
Frontend --> LogisticsOp : Mostra confirmação (VVE criado e In Progress)

@enduml
